1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:03,324
A shared bill should end with everyone
certain—

2
00:00:03,344 --> 00:00:05,334
and no one chasing screenshots.

3
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,282
FINALTab turns a receipt into a
deterministic ledger,

4
00:00:09,544 --> 00:00:13,032
binds each debtor's USDC pull to the whole
payout plan,

5
00:00:13,398 --> 00:00:15,946
then sends the exact call through
KeeperHub.

6
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:19,389
Scan a crowded receipt. Correct any
extraction.

7
00:00:19,546 --> 00:00:22,129
Invite the table. Describe who had what.

8
00:00:22,449 --> 00:00:24,646
FINALTab reconciles every line—

9
00:00:24,666 --> 00:00:26,759
tax, tip, and service included—

10
00:00:26,779 --> 00:00:28,793
to the cent, across the whole table.

11
00:00:31,400 --> 00:00:33,449
The graph collapses many obligations

12
00:00:33,467 --> 00:00:35,875
into a small, deterministic transfer set.

13
00:00:36,241 --> 00:00:39,056
Freeze once, and the ledger hash,
settlement ID,

14
00:00:39,086 --> 00:00:43,143
debits, payouts, chain, and contract
become one immutable plan.

15
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,842
Each debtor signs twice:

16
00:00:46,023 --> 00:00:48,861
Circle authorizes their exact USDC pull;

17
00:00:49,123 --> 00:00:52,054
FINALTab binds consent to the complete
payout plan.

18
00:00:52,315 --> 00:00:55,896
KeeperHub then simulates. A revert never
broadcasts.

19
00:00:56,350 --> 00:01:00,047
After simulation and a final human
signature, KeeperHub submits.

20
00:01:00,483 --> 00:01:02,439
Green appears when its receipt matches

21
00:01:02,457 --> 00:01:05,306
an independent Base Sepolia RPC check.

22
00:01:06,250 --> 00:01:10,052
Agents use the same safety rail through
nine production MCP tools.

23
00:01:10,372 --> 00:01:12,652
FINALTab never holds wallet keys.

24
00:01:13,150 --> 00:01:15,907
The agent allocates, prepares the V2 plan,

25
00:01:15,983 --> 00:01:17,904
and returns debtor typed data.

26
00:01:18,421 --> 00:01:22,339
It simulates, gets a short-lived human
signature, then submits.

27
00:01:22,856 --> 00:01:27,505
Status receives execution ID, settlement
ID, and ledger hash.

28
00:01:27,825 --> 00:01:30,837
Only the indexed event becomes
VERIFIED_SETTLED.

29
00:01:31,050 --> 00:01:34,527
FINALTab: KeeperHub executes. Anyone
verifies.
